# Captured page bodies and text extractions.
#
# agent-skills is a DISTRIBUTED PLUGIN — anything committed here ships to every
# adopter who installs it. So only index.md is tracked: it is a few KB and still
# preserves the full verification chain (URL, access date, SHA-256 per source).
# The captures themselves stay on the author's disk, where they are useful.
#
# See skills/dossier/references/source-archival.md §Repo hygiene.
*.html
*.md
!index.md
